      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not familiar with the `__GENKSYMS__` approach. I\u0027ve uploaded PS#3 but it didn\u0027t have desired effect on the KMI (KMI did not change at all). The documentation mentions I should wrap the definition of `struct gh_rm` with `#ifndef __GENKSYMS__`, but it didn\u0027t seem to have the effect. Am I doing the right thing?",
